WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.343 --> 00:00:02.676
(whooshing)

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.468
- [Evan] What connects your happiness?

00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:16.916
Everything you do is connected
to who you are as a person

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:20.982
and, in turn, creates the
person you are becoming.

00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:25.402
Paul E. Miller, author known
for his books on spirituality.

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:28.531
This is where the magic starts to happen.

00:00:28.531 --> 00:00:30.028
You have your page of all the things

00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:32.141
that make you happy, right?

00:00:32.141 --> 00:00:34.939
If not, do it now, it's important.

00:00:34.939 --> 00:00:38.848
Go back and watch that video,
I want you to take action.

00:00:38.848 --> 00:00:40.642
There is one common theme that connects

00:00:40.642 --> 00:00:42.710
all the things that make you happy.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.363
You might have many reasons why

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:46.323
Mrs. Jones was your favorite teacher.

00:00:46.323 --> 00:00:49.168
There could be 10 things you
love about your favorite movie.

00:00:49.168 --> 00:00:50.547
The people you hang out with

00:00:50.547 --> 00:00:52.676
have lots of different personalities.

00:00:52.676 --> 00:00:54.037
But there is one theme

00:00:54.037 --> 00:00:55.796
that unites them all.

00:00:55.796 --> 00:00:59.050
One thing they together share.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.889
This is a connective tissue that will make

00:01:00.889 --> 00:01:03.443
all your future decisions easier.

00:01:03.443 --> 00:01:05.510
This is the powerful
mantra that will give you

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:07.119
a sense of purpose and help you

00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:09.349
change the world for the better.

00:01:09.349 --> 00:01:11.580
This is your one word.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.772
Find the common theme
in the list of things

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:16.709
that make you happy and write it down.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:18.574
If it doesn't pop off the page,

00:01:18.574 --> 00:01:21.055
then next to each of the
things that make you happy,

00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:23.628
write why you like it.

00:01:23.628 --> 00:01:25.567
You'll notice a pattern that emerges.

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:28.694
Some words will come
up over and over again.

00:01:28.694 --> 00:01:30.726
Take the words you've used most commonly

00:01:30.726 --> 00:01:33.072
to describe your happiest moments,

00:01:33.072 --> 00:01:35.097
and group them together.

00:01:35.097 --> 00:01:38.489
If you can't get it down to
one word yet, don't worry.

00:01:38.489 --> 00:01:41.125
Just try to get the final
list from this exercise

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:43.767
down to five words or fewer.

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:45.701
Now we can take the next step in building

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:48.784
your extraordinary life and business.

00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:08.668
(whooshing)

